  "bio": "Dawid Gaura, an accomplished tattoo artist based in Zakopane, Poland, is renowned for his exceptional illustrative style that captivates and expresses artistic narratives on skin. Priding himself on maintaining an immaculate workspace, Dawid's commitment to cleanliness ensures a safe and hygienic environment for every client who walks into the studio. Whether you're seeking intricate designs or broad strokes of creativity, Dawid's meticulous approach guarantees a tattoo experience that is both impressive and secure.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Zakopane, Woj. Małopolskie, Poland\n\n@thecirclelondon @kamiltattoos Booking: dawidtattoo@gmail.com",
